OL,3,ASuspected sabotage causes major
OL,4,ANetherlands rail disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FParts of the Netherlands, including
OL,7,FAmsterdam, were hit by major rail
OL,8,Fdisruption after suspected sabotage to
OL,9,Fthe tracks on Tuesday morning, the
OL,10,Fcountry's railway infrastructure
OL,11,Foperator said.
OL,13,FProRail said pipes and cables were laid
OL,14,Fon tracks at multiple locations in the
OL,15,Fcountry's centre and north in more than
OL,16,F35 incidents.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
