OL,3,ASuspected sabotage causes major
OL,4,ANetherlands rail disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt added the acts appeared to be
OL,7,Fintentional, causing widespread
OL,8,Fcancellations and delays, with new
OL,9,Fdisruptions occurring in some places
OL,10,Fafter objects had initially been
OL,11,Fremoved.
OL,13,FNo suspects or motives have yet been
OL,14,Fidentified. Police said a criminal
OL,15,Finvestigation had been launched.
